<title>USA: NY/NJ Port Authority deal yields 6.14 pct in 2025.</title>
<headline>NY/NJ Port Authority deal yields 6.14 pct in 2025.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers on Friday tentatively priced a $930 million Port Authority of New York and New Jersey at a top yield of 6.14 percent in 2025, market sources said.</p>
<p>The maturity carries a 5-7/8 percent coupon.</p>
<p>Lehman has not yet released details of the pricing scale.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
